    "descriptionZh": "不绑框架的 Tailwind 组件库，用原生 JavaScript 写。首页把 Accordion 到 Tooltip 三十多个组件按例子数量铺开，装法是 npm i @keenthemes/ktui。",
    "takeawayZh": "npm i @keenthemes/ktui，按示例抄组件",
    "noteZh": "首屏正中是 Tailwind UI Components，下面一枚可复制的 npm i @keenthemes/ktui，再往下铺开四列组件缩略图，每张角上标着例子数——Carousel 17 Examples、Datatable 24 Examples、Select 22 Examples、Toast 18 Examples。上方导航只有 Components、Docs、Studio、GitHub 四项，右侧挂一枚 Weekly new feature releases 胶囊和一个订阅框 Stay notified on every new release。页脚写 ©2026 KtUI，A project by Keenthemes。",
